WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.046 --> 00:00:17.988
Zella said, surprised by her brother's Reveal spell.

2
00:00:18.949 --> 00:00:24.954
As she'd told Loro, Raff was rarely interested in practicing spells, even though he was a Red like

3
00:00:25.014 --> 00:00:25.995
Zann and Gliss.

4
00:00:26.796 --> 00:00:31.560
All Reds were supposed to have strong magic, but her brother was the only one in town.

5
00:00:32.492 --> 00:00:36.695
He didn't like to stand out, so he always wore a hat to cover his red hair.

6
00:00:36.715 --> 00:00:39.357
"Let's see what's inside this tunnel."

7
00:00:40.237 --> 00:00:41.618
Zella started to enter it.

8
00:00:41.638 --> 00:00:43.960
"It must be something interesting.

9
00:00:44.781 --> 00:00:47.162
Otherwise nobody would have bothered to hide it with a spell."

10
00:00:48.723 --> 00:00:51.805
All three kids created lights to help them see better.

11
00:00:52.986 --> 00:00:54.487
Muncher followed them at first.

12
00:00:55.168 --> 00:00:58.150
Then the tunnel grew too narrow, and he backed out.

13
00:00:58.170 --> 00:01:01.032
"See you soon, Muncher," Raff said.

14
00:01:01.960 --> 00:01:06.761
After a short distance, the tunnel opened into a chamber even larger than the first one.

15
00:01:07.722 --> 00:01:10.783
A stone slab stood at the center like a table.

16
00:01:11.703 --> 00:01:15.264
An ancient metal cup sat on it, coated in dust.

17
00:01:16.104 --> 00:01:20.766
On the wall hung a rusty sword, along with the tattered remains of a tapestry.

18
00:01:20.786 --> 00:01:25.327
"Hey!" Zella pointed to another dusty old item.

19
00:01:25.347 --> 00:01:26.967
"That's a crown."

20
00:01:27.748 --> 00:01:28.448
She picked it up.

21
00:01:29.068 --> 00:01:32.110
"Because of those drawings, I thought this was an old troll cave.

22
00:01:32.711 --> 00:01:34.452
But this stuff didn't belong to trolls."

23
00:01:35.372 --> 00:01:36.133
Raff nodded.

24
00:01:36.153 --> 00:01:38.455
"I think I know what this place is!"

25
00:01:39.315 --> 00:01:40.356
He sounded excited.

26
00:01:40.376 --> 00:01:43.638
"Don't you remember our local history classes, Zella?

27
00:01:44.319 --> 00:01:48.441
Experts think old King Zanta had a secret lair where he hid from his enemies."

28
00:01:50.002 --> 00:01:50.843
Zella gasped.

29
00:01:50.863 --> 00:01:53.985
"This cave might be King Zanta's secret hideaway!"

30
00:01:54.005 --> 00:01:57.728
"Really?" Loro sounded dubious.

31
00:01:58.660 --> 00:02:01.182
"We're pretty far down the mountain, aren't we?"

32
00:02:01.202 --> 00:02:05.365
"Yes, we're on the boring part of Mount Mystery," Zella said.

33
00:02:05.385 --> 00:02:07.827
"But you saw that map of the cave.

34
00:02:08.427 --> 00:02:10.108
There are lots of tunnels back here.

35
00:02:10.949 --> 00:02:13.490
Maybe one of them goes all the way up to Zanta's fortress!"

36
00:02:14.711 --> 00:02:18.334
She could hardly believe they'd discovered something so interesting.

37
00:02:19.094 --> 00:02:23.697
This ordinary day was turning into the kind of adventure Zann and his friends might have.

38
00:02:23.717 --> 00:02:26.920
"Let's keep exploring," Raff said.

39
00:02:27.720 --> 00:02:30.061
Several tunnels led off from the chamber.

40
00:02:30.801 --> 00:02:32.822
The first one they tried led to a dead end.

41
00:02:33.803 --> 00:02:37.845
The next opened into a narrow room with more drawings on the walls.

42
00:02:38.585 --> 00:02:44.427
These drawings looked more like symbols and words than art, but they were so old and faded, Zella

43
00:02:44.488 --> 00:02:46.128
couldn't make out many details.

44
00:02:47.409 --> 00:02:49.110
The kids continued to explore.

45
00:02:49.970 --> 00:02:54.112
The tunnels had plenty of twists and turns, and there were lots of other rooms.

46
00:02:54.952 --> 00:02:58.174
Some were large like the first two, and some were smaller.

47
00:02:59.135 --> 00:03:01.836
Once they almost stumbled into a deep, dark hole.

48
00:03:02.857 --> 00:03:04.397
Raff peered down into it.

49
00:03:04.418 --> 00:03:09.040
"I wonder if this was a trap or a hiding place."

50
00:03:09.060 --> 00:03:11.421
"Let's see how deep it is."

51
00:03:12.522 --> 00:03:15.804
Zella snapped her fingers to create an extra ball of light.

52
00:03:16.865 --> 00:03:21.447
The first one she created was too dim, so she rubbed her hands together and tried again.

53
00:03:21.467 --> 00:03:25.029
"Light!" This ball was brighter.

54
00:03:25.709 --> 00:03:27.210
She dropped it into the hole.

55
00:03:27.851 --> 00:03:33.554
It landed on a hard stone floor, showing the hole to be about four times deeper than she

56
00:03:33.635 --> 00:03:34.335
was tall.

57
00:03:35.336 --> 00:03:36.036
Raff grimaced.

58
00:03:36.056 --> 00:03:40.039
"Maybe this hole used to be covered with straw or something.

59
00:03:40.639 --> 00:03:43.621
That way victims wouldn't see it and would fall right in."

60
00:03:43.641 --> 00:03:45.782
"Yeah," Zella said.

61
00:03:45.803 --> 00:03:47.704
"That's pretty creepy."

62
00:03:48.848 --> 00:03:54.332
As they explored, the kids encountered most of the insects and other creatures the map had shown them.

63
00:03:55.032 --> 00:03:58.215
Zella was surprised there weren't more animals living in the cave.

64
00:03:58.235 --> 00:04:03.919
"This would be a perfect den for some of the smaller species of wild dragons," she said as

65
00:04:03.959 --> 00:04:05.800
they peered into another small room.

66
00:04:05.820 --> 00:04:10.503
"I wonder if there used to be a Shield spell at the entrance or something."

67
00:04:10.523 --> 00:04:14.386
"Morb used Zanta's fortress," Loro said.

68
00:04:14.406 --> 00:04:17.148
"Maybe he used this cave too."

69
00:04:18.304 --> 00:04:19.165
"I don't think so."

70
00:04:20.025 --> 00:04:24.047
Raff lit up the footsteps they'd left in the thick layer of dust on the floor.

71
00:04:24.067 --> 00:04:29.350
"It seems like we're the first ones to enter this cave in a long time."

72
00:04:29.370 --> 00:04:34.433
"We've seen some cool stuff," Loro said uneasily.

73
00:04:34.453 --> 00:04:37.475
"But let's go, okay?

74
00:04:38.615 --> 00:04:41.217
I should get home before my parents start to worry."

75
00:04:41.937 --> 00:04:45.439
Zella didn't want to go, but she didn't want Loro to get in trouble.

76
00:04:46.620 --> 00:04:47.120
She nodded.

77
00:04:48.204 --> 00:04:50.946
"We can go now, but let's come back tomorrow morning."

78
00:04:51.987 --> 00:04:53.788
Then she had an even better idea.

79
00:04:53.808 --> 00:04:56.811
"I'm going to send a message to Zann about this place.

80
00:04:57.972 --> 00:04:59.613
His parents might want to check it out!"

81
00:05:00.414 --> 00:05:01.214
Raff smiled.

82
00:05:01.234 --> 00:05:05.978
"And maybe they'll bring the whole gang to Stone Wall so you can meet them?"

83
00:05:07.559 --> 00:05:11.002
Zella grinned, snapping her fingers to summon a message moth.

84
00:05:12.223 --> 00:05:13.724
"Stranger things have happened!"

85
00:05:14.696 --> 00:05:19.339
Zann was walking through First City with Perda when a message moth landed on his finger.

86
00:05:20.380 --> 00:05:23.302
He saw the sender's name and smiled ruefully.

87
00:05:24.383 --> 00:05:27.625
It was from a girl who lived in a tiny town on Mount Mystery.

88
00:05:28.765 --> 00:05:30.006
Perda looked at the moth.

89
00:05:30.026 --> 00:05:32.648
"Is that from our fan Zella?"

90
00:05:33.629 --> 00:05:35.030
"Yes," Zann said.

91
00:05:35.050 --> 00:05:38.432
"Maybe she's writing again to tell us how cool we are.

92
00:05:39.232 --> 00:05:41.294
It's kind of embarrassing to be famous, isn't it?"

93
00:05:41.934 --> 00:05:42.695
Perda shrugged.

94
00:05:42.715 --> 00:05:44.416
"I think it's nice.

95
00:05:45.364 --> 00:05:47.285
We get to meet lots of interesting people."

96
00:05:47.305 --> 00:05:54.388
"True." Zann nodded, feeling glad that Perda had decided to use the zap accelerator to visit that day.

97
00:05:55.168 --> 00:05:59.850
Darb and Gliss were busy and couldn't come, but he was always happy to hang out with Perda.

98
00:06:00.950 --> 00:06:03.912
He scanned the words inscribed on the moth's wings.

99
00:06:03.932 --> 00:06:07.073
"Zella and some other kids found a cave.

100
00:06:07.833 --> 00:06:10.074
They think old King Zanta used to hide out there."

101
00:06:11.014 --> 00:06:12.555
"Really?" Perda said.

102
00:06:12.575 --> 00:06:15.673
"That's cool—if it's true.

103
00:06:16.493 --> 00:06:18.115
Maybe we should tell your parents."

104
00:06:19.216 --> 00:06:20.116
Zann smiled.

105
00:06:20.617 --> 00:06:24.180
Perda loved any chance to visit the lab where his parents worked.

106
00:06:24.200 --> 00:06:26.101
"Sure, why not."

107
00:06:27.042 --> 00:06:27.963
He grabbed her hand.
